Narrator: Sutherland approaches his daughter who's on the couch laying down but not sleeping. A visible scar is on her face. It's clear they haven't spoken for some time.
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Sutherland/Elise Im Sorry.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Sutherland: Elise... Look, I... I'm sorry.
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Elise/Im Tired Im Going to Sleep.mp3" volume="-5.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Elise: (cutting him off) I'm tired. I'm going to sleep.